#: templates/privacy.html:15
msgid "1. Introduction"
msgstr ""

#: templates/privacy.html:16
msgid ""
"Welcome to the Application Tracking System. We respect your privacy and "
"are committed to protecting your personal data. This privacy policy will "
"inform you as to how we look after your personal data when you visit our "
"website (regardless of where you visit it from) and tell you about your "
"privacy rights and how the law protects you."
msgstr ""

#: templates/privacy.html:18
msgid "2. The Data We Collect About You"
msgstr ""

#: templates/privacy.html:19
msgid ""
"Personal data, or personal information, means any information about an "
"individual from which that person can be identified. It does not include "
"data where the identity has been removed (anonymous data)."
msgstr ""

#: templates/privacy.html:21
msgid "Identity Data"
msgstr ""

#: templates/privacy.html:21
msgid "includes first name, last name, username or similar identifier."
msgstr ""

#: templates/privacy.html:22
msgid "Contact Data"
msgstr ""

#: templates/privacy.html:22
msgid "includes email address and telephone numbers."
msgstr ""

#: templates/privacy.html:23
msgid "Technical Data"
msgstr ""

#: templates/privacy.html:23
msgid ""
"includes internet protocol (IP) address, your login data, browser type "
"and version, time zone setting and location."
msgstr ""

#: templates/privacy.html:26
msgid "3. How We Use Your Personal Data"
msgstr ""

#: templates/privacy.html:27
msgid ""
"We will only use your personal data when the law allows us to. Most "
"commonly, we will use your personal data in the following circumstances:"
msgstr ""

#: templates/privacy.html:29
msgid ""
"Where we need to perform the service we are about to enter into or have "
"entered into with you (e.g., tracking applications)."
msgstr ""

#: templates/privacy.html:30
msgid ""
"Where it is necessary for our legitimate interests (or those of a third "
"party) and your interests and fundamental rights do not override those "
"interests."
msgstr ""

#: templates/privacy.html:31
msgid "Where we need to comply with a legal or regulatory obligation."
msgstr ""

#: templates/privacy.html:34
msgid "4. Data Security"
msgstr ""

#: templates/privacy.html:35
msgid ""
"We have put in place appropriate security measures to prevent your "
"personal data from being accidentally lost, used or accessed in an "
"unauthorised way, altered or disclosed. In addition, we limit access to "
"your personal data to those employees, agents, contractors and other "
"third parties who have a business need to know. They will only process "
"your personal data on our instructions and they are subject to a duty of "
"confidentiality."
msgstr ""

